  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ret100-500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Ret 201.04 Appearances",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-04-11",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ret 201.04 Appearances. An individual member, employer, or beneficiary may appear in a proceeding governed by this chapter, either personally or through a representative duly authorized by a power of attorney executed by the individual, which provides the following information:\n\n(a) Name, address, and telephone number of the individual member, employer, or beneficiary;\n\n(b) Name, address, and telephone number of representative;\n\n(c) Name and, if available, case number of the proceeding;\n\n(d) Statements of authority granted to representative; and\n\n(e) Signature of the individual member, employer, or beneficiary.\n\nSource. #5225, eff 9-18-91; ss by #5880, eff 8-19-94, EXPIRED: 8-19-00\n\nNew. #7374, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7477, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7572, eff 10-10-01; ss by #12709, eff 1-9-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ret100-500.html"
